%% Figure 3.5 — One Heartbeat Cycle
%% Appears in: Chapter 3, Sequence Diagram
%% Render to: ../fig_3_5_sequence.png
sequenceDiagram
  actor Scheduler
  participant Agent
  participant Store
  participant Sources as Loki / Prometheus / Probes / Docker
  participant Model as Configured LLM
  participant Ntfy as ntfy

  Scheduler->>Agent: start heartbeat
  Agent->>Store: fetch active acknowledgements
  Store-->>Agent: known conditions
  Agent->>Sources: collect bounded telemetry
  Sources-->>Agent: snapshot and collection status
  Agent->>Model: analyse telemetry plus known conditions
  Model-->>Agent: structured verdict and signature
  opt high or critical and Docker monitoring enabled
    Agent->>Sources: collect container diagnostics
    Sources-->>Agent: diagnostic context
  end
  Agent->>Store: persist verdict and fingerprint
  opt high or critical
    Agent->>Ntfy: send alert with recommendation
    Ntfy-->>Agent: delivery result
  end
  Note over Agent,Store: No service change is executed by the heartbeat
